@startuml 03a-create-meeting-form
!include _style.iuml
title Activity 3a — Create a Meeting (User & Frontend)

|#F7F5FB|User|
start
if (How is creation started?) then (drag across time slots)
  |#EEF3FB|Frontend (React + FullCalendar)|
  :select handler receives start / end;
  if (All-day selection\n(month view)?) then (yes)
    :Default to 9:00–10:00\non the first selected day;
  else (no)
    :Use the selected time range;
  endif
  :Clear calendar selection;
else (click "+ New meeting")
  |Frontend (React + FullCalendar)|
  :Default to the next full hour,\nlasting 1 hour;
endif

:Open CreateMeetingDialog\nwith start / end pre-filled;

fork
  :Send GET /api/users;
  |#F2F8F1|Backend API (Express)|
  :listUsersController\n→ findAllUsers()\n(SELECT … FROM users ORDER BY name);
  :Respond 200 { data: Person[] };
  |Frontend (React + FullCalendar)|
  :Populate organizer dropdown\nand attendee chips;
fork again
  |User|
  :Enter title and description,\nadjust start / end;
end fork

|User|
repeat
  :Choose organizer;
  :Click attendee chips to cycle\nrequired → optional → off;
  :Click "Create meeting";

  |Frontend (React + FullCalendar)|
  :Client-side validation:\ntitle, organizer, ≥1 attendee, end > start;
  if (Form valid?) then (no)
    :Show inline error message;
  else (yes)
    :Disable button ("Saving…");
    :Send POST /api/meetings\n(times converted to ISO / UTC);
    |Backend API (Express)|
    :Validate, apply business rules\nand persist in a transaction\n(see Activity 3b);
    |Frontend (React + FullCalendar)|
    if (Response 201?) then (no — 422 / 500 / network)
      :Show server error message;
      :Re-enable "Create meeting";
    else (yes)
    endif
  endif
  |User|
repeat while (Meeting saved?) is (no — correct and retry) not (yes)

|Frontend (React + FullCalendar)|
:Close dialog;
:calendarApi.refetchEvents()\n(see Activity 1);
:Open details panel for\nthe new meeting (see Activity 2);
|User|
stop

floating note right
  At any point the user can **Cancel**
  (button, Esc, or click outside):
  the dialog closes and nothing is saved.
end note
@enduml
